# No `omit=optional` (removed 2026-10-28, roadmap task 14).
#
# Until pdfjs-dist 6 this file skipped optional dependencies: pdfjs 4 declared the old `canvas` and
# `path2d` as optional, and `canvas` dragged in @mapbox/node-pre-gyp -> tar (a critical and a high
# advisory) without ever building. pdfjs 6 declares only `@napi-rs/canvas` (prebuilt N-API binaries,
# no node-gyp, no tar) -- itself shipped as OPTIONAL per-platform packages, so `omit=optional` would
# silently drop it, which is exactly what made the "Cannot polyfill DOMMatrix / Path2D" warnings.
# Its version is pinned by `overrides` in package.json.
